<figure aria-labelledby="r30-move-title">
  <figcaption id="r30-move-title"><span>Figure 1</span> A new copy is not yet a replacement voter</figcaption>
  <replica-move>
    <p class="stage" data-title>The current group</p>
    <div class="panels"><div><strong>Authoritative membership</strong><p data-membership>A, B, C · majority 2</p><strong>Write authority</strong><p data-authority>A</p></div><div><strong>Destination D</strong><p data-d>No replica yet</p><strong>Purchase history</strong><p data-history>Before purchase: P7 stock 1; order 103 absent</p></div></div>
    <p class="explanation" data-explanation aria-live="polite"></p>
    <div class="controls" role="group" aria-label="Figure 1 playback"><button data-play>Play</button><button data-back>Back</button><button data-next>Next</button><button data-reset>Reset</button><span data-step></span><div data-hold aria-hidden="true"><span></span></div></div>
  </replica-move>
  <p class="caption">One chosen group, A–B–C → B–C–D, using a learner and a Raft-style joint transition. P7 and order 103 are deliberately placed together for this drawing; P3 and line effects belong to the same complete purchase but are omitted from the panels. This is an explanatory schedule, not a native trace, exact message sequence or timing model. Products may use other safe membership protocols.</p>
  <details><summary>Read the six stages</summary><p>The current group accepts writes. D starts copying an older snapshot without a vote. The snapshot is installed but misses purchase 103. D catches up, still without independent authority. A committed joint configuration requires a majority of each old and new voter set; authority transfers under the protocol. The final B–C–D configuration commits and A is removed from this group. The purchase survives every stage after its commit.</p></details>
</figure>
<script>
 import {stepper} from '../../figures/stepper.mjs';
 import {stages} from './movement.mjs';
 class ReplicaMove extends HTMLElement {
  connectedCallback(){if(this.dataset.ready)return;this.dataset.ready='true';stepper(this,{steps:()=>stages.length,draw:(i:number)=>{const s=stages[i];for(const key of ['title','membership','authority','d','history'] as const)this.querySelector(`[data-${key}]`)!.textContent=s[key];this.querySelector('[data-explanation]')!.textContent=s.note;}});}
 }
 if(!customElements.get('replica-move'))customElements.define('replica-move',ReplicaMove);
</script>
<style>
 figure{margin:2.5rem 0}figcaption{font:1.25rem/1.4 var(--font-serif);margin-bottom:.8rem}figcaption>span{font:.75rem var(--font-sans);text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--color-text-secondary);margin-right:.6rem}replica-move{display:block;border:1px solid var(--color-text-secondary);padding:1rem;font:.9rem/1.5 var(--font-sans)}.stage{font-weight:600;margin:0 0 1rem}.panels{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:1rem}.panels>div{border:1px solid var(--color-text-secondary);padding:.8rem;min-width:0}.panels p{margin:.4rem 0 1rem;overflow-wrap:anywhere}.panels p:last-child{margin-bottom:0}.explanation{min-height:6rem;border-left:3px solid var(--color-accent);padding:.5rem .8rem}.controls{display:flex;gap:.5rem;flex-wrap:wrap;align-items:center;border-top:1px solid var(--color-text-secondary);padding-top:1rem}.controls>span{margin-left:auto;font-size:.8rem}button{font:.85rem/1.4 var(--font-sans);padding:.45rem;border:1px solid var(--color-text-secondary);border-radius:.25rem;background:var(--color-surface-alt);color:var(--color-text);cursor:pointer}button:focus-visible{outline:3px solid var(--color-accent);outline-offset:3px}button[aria-disabled=true]{opacity:.5}[data-hold]{width:100%;height:3px;background:var(--color-surface-alt)}[data-hold] span{display:block;height:100%;width:0;background:var(--color-accent)}.caption,details{font:.85rem/1.5 var(--font-sans);color:var(--color-text-secondary)}@media(max-width:550px){.panels{grid-template-columns:1fr}.explanation{min-height:0}}
</style>
